#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/isomorphic-lib-v21/.ai/docs/framework.component.html:60
msgid "For a feature such as listing users, an Angular component calls an API service. The service calls a Taon controller endpoint. The controller uses a repository to query the"
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/isomorphic-lib-v21/.ai/docs/framework.component.html:60
msgid "entity and returns the result. The context registers the backend building blocks that the feature uses."
